From: u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com (Karl Broman)
Date: Wed, 20 Dec 2017 16:41:44 +0000
Subject: Re: riself4 format
Message-ID: <XH2AtDcQDw8.UIIp_3YPAQAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <XH2AtDcQDw8.bIzdUInQAAAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <XH2AtDcQDw8.jbSaKG7MAAAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com> <XH2AtDcQDw8.bIzdUInQAAAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
